      "content": "writing or walking feels so pointless when the walls are just closing in anyway. it doesnt change the fact that i'm stuck here. it feels like i'm just stuck in a loop of nothingness. i thought i was looking for freedom but i just found a different kind of prison. it feels like the only way to actually break the cycle is to just stop everything. do you think it's even possible to actually escape a life that feels this empty?",
